WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.059
Zann kept watching in horror as the smoke sucked the last bit of energy out of the troll.

2
00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:11.020
The creature grunted weakly, and the other trolls stared at it, not understanding what had happened.

3
00:00:11.021 --> 00:00:15.351
One by one, they grunted and fell over as the smoke surrounded them.

4
00:00:15.352 --> 00:00:21.018
"Excellent!" Morb cackled as the last of the trolls crumpled to the ground.

5
00:00:21.019 --> 00:00:26.373
The smoke was still expanding. Slib backed away, keeping out of range.

6
00:00:26.374 --> 00:00:32.109
"Er, how do you turn it off, Your Majesty?" he asked nervously.

7
00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:40.362
Morb laughed. "I don't." With one hard shove, he sent Slib stumbling into the smoke.

8
00:00:40.363 --> 00:00:45.925
"No!" Slib struggled to escape as the smoke wrapped its tendrils around him.

9
00:00:45.926 --> 00:00:48.882
Moments later he lay on the ground, panting.

10
00:00:48.883 --> 00:00:53.095
"I've lost my magic!" he cried.

11
00:00:53.096 --> 00:00:56.673
Zann could see Boz and the others still frozen in place.

12
00:00:56.674 --> 00:00:59.408
And the smoke was slowly drifting toward them.

13
00:00:59.409 --> 00:01:02.552
If it reached them, they would all lose their magic!

14
00:01:02.553 --> 00:01:06.504
"Getting nervous, boy?" Morb cackled again.

15
00:01:06.505 --> 00:01:10.845
Zann quickly pointed at Morb. "Blast!" he shouted.

16
00:01:10.846 --> 00:01:14.403
Morb lifted a hand and deflected Zann's Blast spell.

17
00:01:14.404 --> 00:01:18.647
"You can't stop me." Morb laughed.

18
00:01:18.648 --> 00:01:24.874
The smoke was coming toward Zann. He looked at the jawbone perched atop the magic-sucking machine.

19
00:01:24.875 --> 00:01:29.796
"Hmm," he thought. "I stopped the other machine by removing that skull."

20
00:01:29.797 --> 00:01:32.780
Zann held out a hand toward the jawbone.

21
00:01:32.781 --> 00:01:35.310
"Come to me," he murmured.

22
00:01:35.311 --> 00:01:37.776
The jawbone shifted slightly.

23
00:01:37.777 --> 00:01:42.545
Morb scowled. "Haven't you learned that you're no match for me?"

24
00:01:42.546 --> 00:01:49.593
Morb held up a hand. A shaft of energy shot out, blocking Zann's Transport spell and burning his hand.

25
00:01:49.594 --> 00:01:56.364
"Ouch!" Zann cried. But, holding out his hand again, he commanded, "Come to me."

26
00:01:56.365 --> 00:02:02.724
"You just won't give up, will you?" said Morb, sending several bolts of energy toward Zann.

27
00:02:02.725 --> 00:02:07.839
Zann jumped out of the way, and the wall behind him exploded.

28
00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:10.855
Morb strode over to the magic-sucking machine.

29
00:02:10.856 --> 00:02:14.823
"Now I'll show you why there's no point in fighting me."

30
00:02:14.824 --> 00:02:19.774
Morb dipped his hand into the tank and scooped out some of the magic-infused water.

31
00:02:19.775 --> 00:02:26.260
But before he could take a sip, his talisman began to glow, and his hand froze in place.

32
00:02:26.261 --> 00:02:32.695
Glancing over, Zann could see Fala entering the courtyard. In her hand was the troll talisman.

33
00:02:32.696 --> 00:02:36.872
"How did you . . . ?" Morb cried, unable to move his hand.

34
00:02:36.873 --> 00:02:45.184
Although Morb was immobilized, he apparently still had enough magic to maintain the Flash Freeze he'd placed on Boz and the others.

35
00:02:45.185 --> 00:02:52.802
And the smoke was now just inches from them. Fala was frantically trying to free them with the talisman, but it wasn't working.

36
00:02:52.803 --> 00:02:57.359
Zann turned his gaze back to the jawbone and focused all his energy.

37
00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:02.003
"Come to me," he murmured again, holding out his hand.

38
00:03:02.004 --> 00:03:06.414
The jawbone leaped off the machine, and the smoke disappeared instantly.

39
00:03:06.415 --> 00:03:10.380
As soon as Zann caught the bone, its magic energized him. He

40
00:03:10.381 --> 00:03:14.734
could feel sparks flying; his eyes felt strange. Pointing

41
00:03:14.735 --> 00:03:18.364
at Boz and the others, he shouted, "Free!" Energy

42
00:03:18.365 --> 00:03:25.011
shot out everywhere. Within a moment all the frozen people were able to move again. But

43
00:03:25.012 --> 00:03:31.230
the chaotic magic had also freed Morb, who still had the magic-infused water in his hand. He

44
00:03:31.231 --> 00:03:33.708
raised his hand to his lips. Using

45
00:03:33.709 --> 00:03:39.025
a Blast spell, Zann quickly knocked Morb down, causing him to spill the water. Then

46
00:03:39.026 --> 00:03:42.183
he blasted the tank on the machine. "No!"

47
00:03:42.184 --> 00:03:48.642
Morb howled as the last of the liquid was absorbed into the ground. Zann

48
00:03:48.643 --> 00:03:51.898
lifted the jawbone over his head to smash it. Morb's

49
00:03:51.899 --> 00:03:59.047
eyes filled with panic. "Wait!" he blurted out. "I have a proposition for you!" "I'm

50
00:03:59.048 --> 00:04:02.201
not interested," Zann said. "Oh,

51
00:04:02.202 --> 00:04:07.260
you'll be interested in this ," Morb said quickly, standing up.

52
00:04:07.261 --> 00:04:11.205
"How would you like to know what happened to your parents?"

53
00:04:11.206 --> 00:04:15.179
"I already know about the accident," said Zann.

54
00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:18.309
Morb was silent for a moment and then spoke.

55
00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:24.689
"Let me tell you something, young man. Your parents' disappearance was no accident."

56
00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:27.984
Zann was confused. "Wyssa said—"

57
00:04:27.985 --> 00:04:33.028
Morb chuckled. "Yes, Wyssa thinks it was an accident.

58
00:04:33.029 --> 00:04:40.041
She also thinks it was her fault—that's how I've been able to blackmail her all this time."

59
00:04:40.042 --> 00:04:44.013
Boz called out, "Don't listen to him, Zann!"

60
00:04:44.014 --> 00:04:49.817
But Zann barely heard his grandfather. Could Morb tell him what really happened to his parents?

61
00:04:49.818 --> 00:04:53.261
Morb's lips curled into an evil grin.

62
00:04:53.262 --> 00:05:00.410
"Just hand me the Mouth of the Undead, Zann, and I'll tell you where your parents are."

63
00:05:00.411 --> 00:05:03.585
"You know where they are?" said Zann.

64
00:05:03.586 --> 00:05:09.567
"Of course I know where they are," Morb retorted. "Would you like to see them?"

65
00:05:09.568 --> 00:05:14.729
"What?" Zann thought. His parents were alive, and he could see them again . . .?

66
00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:17.340
The arms holding the bone dropped slightly.

67
00:05:17.341 --> 00:05:21.321
Morb saw that his words were working—he was getting to the boy.

68
00:05:21.322 --> 00:05:26.109
"I'll even let your grandfather go with you," he added.

69
00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:35.224
Zann looked at Boz. The old man had a faint smile that seemed to say, "I know you'll make the right choice." Zann breathed deeply.

70
00:05:35.225 --> 00:05:39.304
He knew what that choice was. He looked back at Morb.

71
00:05:39.305 --> 00:05:42.459
"Can I bring Darb too?" Zann asked.

72
00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:44.524
"Who?" asked Morb.

73
00:05:44.525 --> 00:05:51.732
"What about Perda?" Zann added. "And Gliss? Fala? Teplo? Can they all come with me?

74
00:05:51.733 --> 00:05:55.861
What about everyone else over there? What about the rest of Magica?"

75
00:05:55.862 --> 00:05:59.788
"Wh-what are you talking about?" Morb stammered.

76
00:05:59.789 --> 00:06:05.766
Zann stared deep into Morb's eyes. "You have nothing to offer me, Morb.

77
00:06:05.767 --> 00:06:13.188
Maybe you can't understand this, but I would never turn my back on my friends—or Magica."

78
00:06:13.189 --> 00:06:18.771
Zann raised the jawbone over his head and threw it down as hard as he could.

79
00:06:18.772 --> 00:06:22.885
Morb's eyes widened with horror. "No—!"

80
00:06:22.886 --> 00:06:33.231
There was a deafening crack, and the two splintered halves of the bone skidded across the cold floor.

